5. THE "LOOK CLOSELY" SECTION
This becomes an important part of the Jenny Dunlop identity.

LOOK CLOSELY...
There's more going on than you think.

My work starts with pen and paint. Then I add tiny pieces of Liberty fabric before finishing each piece with free-machine stitching.

Familiar places, animals and everyday things — usually with a little bit of fun thrown in.

Use close-up photography here:

stitching

Liberty fabric

pen marks

paint

Jenny's hands working

artwork in progress

This tells customers why the artwork is special rather than simply showing them something and a price.

