12. WHOLESALE CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE
Once approved and signed in, a stockist can access their trade buying experience.

Products can have:

Retail price
Wholesale price
Minimum quantities
Pack quantities where necessary

They can:

browse trade products

see wholesale pricing

order online

reorder

see previous orders

manage their account

Shopify's current native B2B system supports company/customer accounts, catalogs, quantity rules, volume pricing, payment terms and self-service ordering on Basic.

Initially we should use one straightforward UK wholesale catalogue, rather than making the wholesale system unnecessarily complicated.

