20. WHAT HAPPENS TO JENNYDUNLOPART?
JennyDunlopArt should eventually stop operating as a separate ecommerce website.

Its domain should redirect appropriately to the new Jenny & Co website so existing links and people looking for Jenny Dunlop can still find the work.

The Jenny Dunlop name remains prominent throughout the new website.

Jenny & Co becomes the umbrella.

