PHASE THREE — PRODUCTS
Rather than dumping everything from the old website into the new one, curate it.

Choose the work that still feels Jenny.

Create consistent photographs.

Rewrite product descriptions.

Set prices.

Create collections.

Upload products.

This is a chance to edit the range, not simply migrate it.

PHASE FOUR — WHOLESALE
Set up Shopify B2B.

Create UK wholesale catalogue.

Set trade prices.

Set minimum quantities where appropriate.

Create wholesale application page.

Create wholesale login.

Test the entire ordering process as if we were a stockist.

Shopify now supports B2B and normal retail from the same store, which suits this structure particularly well.

