22. LAUNCH
Don't just quietly replace the website.

Make it an event.

JENNY & CO HAS A NEW HOME
New website.
New artwork.
New way to shop.
Wholesale now available.

Use Instagram posts, stories and the mailing list to launch it.

Possibly release a small collection of new originals at the same time so people have a reason to visit rather than merely announcing a redesign.

THE RULE FOR THE WHOLE PROJECT
Whenever we're deciding whether to add something, ask:

Does this help someone fall in love with Jenny's work or make it easier to buy?

If not, we probably don't need it.

The website should be:

Beautiful. Personal. Easy.

Not complicated.

Not corporate.

Not Etsy.

Not a generic Shopify store.

Jenny & Co.
